{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Job Records: submit one half-finished job\u2019s state: the job and its objective, the current draft or work product reference, completed steps, open questions, files or records produced, decisions already made and what remains. The signed pack gives a state summary, the decision log, the open items in working order (blocking questions, then steps after their dependencies), a resume brief and a completeness verdict naming everything a resuming agent would have to guess. Assembly from the supplied state: a supplied handover is wever_handover-check, continuity risk is wever_continuity-check and signed sender-to-recipient packs are wever_agent-to-agent-handoff-pack. Verdict not_resumable, resumable_with_gaps or resumable. POST /api/job-handoff-pack. Reads only the material in the call: no network request, fetch, wallet or merchant lookup, order, payment or external write. Paid URL: 0.10 USDC per call on Base via x402 exact, with the shared 10 signed-wallet free calls per rolling 30 days. Bind X-Wever-Wallet-Proof to the exact JSON arguments and the tool route. Returns a report with an Ed25519 signed receipt. Contract: /api/job-records-contract. Human page: https://weverlabs.com/job-records/.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"artifacts":{"description":"Files or records produced.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"maxLength":4000,"minLength":1,"pattern":"\\S","type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"pattern":"\\S","type":"string"},"reference":{"description":"Path, URL or record ID.","maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"pattern":"\\S","type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":200,"minItems":0,"type":"array"},"asset":{"description":"Asset or currency code, such as USDC or USD.","maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"pattern":"\\S","type":"string"},"budget_remaining":{"an